// Emitted by the C++ capability-spec-consuming renderers (GenSoliditySpec /
// GenPostgresSpec) when an INGESTED capability-spec's serialized AST or
// structure is
// malformed (missing sections, a non-ref idempotency key, no success
// terminal, a non-int literal operand, etc.). An ill-typed ingested compute
// is re-typed and rejected as expr.type, not here (--from-spec ingestion,
// WP6/).
